# ─── Document service addressing ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Document API calls are PROXY-BASED. template.api.ts emits relative paths
# (`/api/v1/...`) and the Vite dev proxy (see vite.config.ts) rewrites them to
# `/document/api/v1/...` on the local backend. No document host env var needed.
